  },
  "notes": [
    "Microsoft Foundry lists this Anthropic-infrastructure offering as Preview; status describes that offering, not a universal lifecycle across Claude API, Bedrock and Vertex.",
    "Anthropic's exact-model pricing table, checked 2026-10-11, publishes cache-read and both TTL-specific cache-write rates. Regional surcharges and discounts are not included.",
